# CRITICAL: this project's scientific integrity rests on SHA-256 digests taken
# over exact file bytes (frozen manifests, P1--P6 artifacts, benchmark outputs).
# Any end-of-line normalisation by Git would silently change those bytes and
# break every published identity. All EOL conversion is therefore disabled.
* -text

# Belt and braces: never treat published evidence as convertible text.
*.csv   -text
*.json  -text
*.yaml  -text
*.md    -text
*.log   -text
*.zeek  -text

# Opaque binaries.
*.joblib binary
*.pkl    binary
*.pcap   binary
*.png    binary
*.pdf    binary
